lass=\"screen-reader-text\">飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑.webp 1067w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑-512x768.webp 512w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-08T09:05:21+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/08/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>七夕上午，我一边忙着工作的事儿一边在收拾家里，准备第二天会老家给奶奶过生日，同时看看已有一月未见的果果，可不曾想接到妈妈的电话，她略带哭腔的说：你爸爸被车撞了...！ 我第一反应是追问人伤得怎么样，听到“暂时没有生命危险…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/\"><span>阅读全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/","retrieved":1757310438958},{"title":"仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bac